THOROUGH
main.cpp
--cpp11 --object-bits 12 --unwind 5 --no-unwinding-assertions
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line 8 regex match: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
std::regex construction + regex_match over libstdc++ <regex>.  Front-end
conversion is complete and deterministic (scope lookups are ordered by
cpp_idt::ordinal, not by pointer): the qualified friend
`__detail::__regex_algo_impl` is recorded for match_results so its
`_Unchecked& __res = __m` binding to the private vector base is
accessible, and iterator_traits<const char*> selects the `const _Tp*`
partial specialisation (value_type `char`, not `const char`), so the
_Executor is built over basic_regex<char, ...>.  Remaining cost is
symbolic execution of the NFA compiler and executor (> 30 min at
--unwind 5).  The CORE conversion gate is in test_conversion.desc.
